ion4":null,"Classification5":null,"Classification6":null,"FavoritesStatus":false,"Station":null,"Kind":"全职","Channel4IsHot":false,"Channel4IsLong":false,"Status":1,"Channel4HasReward":false,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendScore":null,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendReward":null,"Channel4RewardDescription":null,"IsCollect":false,"IsDelivered":false,"SubmissionLimit":null,"BelongStoreId":null,"Degree":"本科","YearsOfWorking":"3年","WorkTime":null,"Insurance":null,"Welfare":null,"WorkWeChatQrCode":null,"Channel4IsAllowCampusRecommend":false,"Channel4CampusReward":null,"Channel4CampusScore":null,"Channel4CampusRewardDescription":null,"Channel4IsAllowExternalRecommend":false,"Channel4ExternalReward":null,"Channel4ExternalScore":null,"Channel4ExternalRewardDescription":null,"InnerChannelIsTop":false,"Channel4SequenceNumber":"","ChangeDate":"2026-06-25T11:54:06","JobVideoJd":null,"IsAllowRepeatDeliverSameJob":false,"AllowRepeatDeliverCount":0,"RepeatDeliverCount":0,"IsShowReward":false,"DetailAddress":null,"RewardText":null,"IsTop":false,"Cash":0,"CashText":null,"HideCash":false,"Score":0,"ScoreText":null,"HideScore":false,"HrDutyUser":null,"DutyUserId":0,"JobId":0,"RewardImgUrl":null,"RewardAttUrl":null,"RewardAttName":null,"JobAdNameWithoutJobCode":null,"Distance":null},{"Id":"70aaf2a5-015e-49db-8f1e-96d5e3eb66a8","HeadCount":0,"JobAdId":151203061,"PostDateInt":1781230060000,"PostDate":"2026-06-12T10:07:40","EndTimeInt":0,"EndTime":"0001-01-01T00:00:00","JobAdName":"储能系统经理(J12528)","OrgId":3201285,"Org":"浙江冠宇电源有限公司","Category":"社会招聘","CategoryId":"1","LocId":null,"LocNames":["浙江省·嘉兴市"],"Salary":"面议","Duty":"1、牵头负责适配锂电储能、AIDC智算中心、高功率UPS场景的512V标准化储能柜子系统设计，覆盖55ah、65ah、110ah、130ah全规格产品的方案定义、架构设计与开发落地，统筹从需求分析到量产交付的全流程研发管理；\n2、主导系统方案的电气设计、热管理设计、结构集成设计与安全防护设计，结合高功率应用场景特性，优化系统能量密度、散热效率与可靠性，解决大电流、高负载下的系统稳定性问题；\n3、协调结构、电气、硬件、测试等跨部门团队，对接供应链与生产部门完成设计转化，解决研发到量产过程中的工艺、成本、性能冲突问题，输出符合量产要求的设计规范与技术文档；\n4、负责产品设计过程中的风险识别与验证规划，组织完成系统型式试验、可靠性测试与场景适配测试，跟进问题整改，确保产品满足安规标准与客户应用需求；\n5、跟踪储能行业技术发展趋势与AIDC智算中心的功率需求变化，推动现有512V柜子产品的技术迭代与成本优化，支撑产品线的市场竞争力提升；\n6、配合市场与销售团队完成客户需求转化、技术交流与方案答疑，参与重大项目的技术方案评审，输出满足客户定制化需求的系统设计调整方案。","Require":"1、本科及以上学历，电力电子、电气工程、电化学、能源与动力等相关专业，5年以上储能系统集成/系统设计相关工作经验，有头部储能企业产品开发经验优先；\n2、熟悉储能系统拓扑结构、电气设计与集成流程，掌握BMS、PCS、电池簇匹配设计逻辑，有锂电储能高功率系统设计经验，参与过500V以上电压等级储能柜产品开发落地者优先；\n3、了解AIDC智算中心、高功率UPS的应用场景需求，熟悉储能产品相关安规标准（如IEC、GB等）与测试验证方法，能够独立完成系统设计方案与验证计划制定；\n4、具备多规格标准化产品的平台化设计经验，能够平衡性能、成本与可制造性要求，熟练使用至少一种电气设计仿真工具与CAD设计软件；\n5、具备良好的跨团队沟通协调能力与项目管理能力，能够推动多团队并行开发，解决研发过程中的各类技术问题，结果导向意识强；\n6、对储能行业技术发展有敏感度，具备主动创新意识，能够承受一定的项目交付压力，适应研发型企业的快节奏工作模式。","ClassificationOne":"研发类","ClassificationTwo":"浙江","Classification3":null,"Classification4":null,"Classification5":null,"Classification6":null,"FavoritesStatus":false,"Station":null,"Kind":"全职","Channel4IsHot":true,"Channel4IsLong":false,"Status":1,"Channel4HasReward":false,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendScore":null,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendReward":null,"Channel4RewardDescription":null,"IsCollect":false,"IsDelivered":false,"SubmissionLimit":null,"BelongStoreId":null,"Degree":null,"YearsOfWorking":null,"WorkTime":null,"Insurance":null,"Welfare":null,"WorkWeChatQrCode":null,"Channel4IsAllowCampusRecommend":false,"Channel4CampusReward":null,"Channel4CampusScore":null,"Channel4CampusRewardDescription":null,"Channel4IsAllowExternalRecommend":false,"Channel4ExternalReward":null,"Channel4ExternalScore":null,"Channel4ExternalRewardDescription":null,"InnerChannelIsTop":false,"Channel4SequenceNumber":"","ChangeDate":"2026-06-12T10:07:40","JobVideoJd":null,"IsAllowRepeatDeliverSameJob":false,"AllowRepeatDeliverCount":0,"RepeatDeliverCount":0,"IsShowReward":false,"DetailAddress":null,"RewardText":null,"IsTop":false,"Cash":0,"CashText":null,"HideCash":false,"Score":0,"ScoreText":null,"HideScore":false,"HrDutyUser":null,"DutyUserId":0,"JobId":0,"RewardImgUrl":null,"RewardAttUrl":null,"RewardAttName":null,"JobAdNameWithoutJobCode":null,"Distance":null},{"Id":"7f19392d-5d84-40be-8445-5c4be9ff0ca0","HeadCount":0,"JobAdId":151203054,"PostDateInt":1781229909000,"PostDate":"2026-06-12T10:05:09","EndTimeInt":0,"EndTime":"0001-01-01T00:00:00","JobAdName":"结构开发工程师（储能）(J12527)","OrgId":3201285,"Org":"浙江冠宇电源有限公司","Category":"社会招聘","CategoryId":"1","LocId":null,"LocNames":["浙江省·嘉兴市"],"Salary":"面议","Duty":"完成储能（数据中心、电力储能、工商业储能）PACK、电气柜、集装箱结构设计&交付。\n1、根据产品及市场需求，配合完成PACK、电池柜、集装箱设计，完成结构3D、2D图出图，跟进供应商样箱试制，确保样机质量。\n2、编制总装Bom，输出工艺技术文件(DFMEA、工艺要求、质量控制要点等)，跟进小批量试产，识别优化试产中的结构问题。\n3、解决产品试商用时发现的结构问题，完成设计优化及ECN流程。\n4、总结PACK、电气柜、集装箱结构设计经验，整理提炼技术文档(包括但不限于设计规范、专利、经验总结等)。\n5、配合采购部门开发、考核供应商，输出供应商技术能力和价格合理性评估报告。\n6、持续优化结构方案，降低设计成本，提升产品质量及产线效率。","Require":"1、具备本科及以上学历，机械设计、模具设计、机电一体化等相关专业；\n2、具有3年以上产品结构设计工作经验，有从事高低压电气柜、pack模组设计、集装箱集成设计工作经验者优先；\n3、熟悉常用五金或塑胶结构设计，熟悉材料性能，熟悉加工工艺及成型原理，熟悉各类常用材料的表面处理工艺和流程，对散热设计有一定经验及心得；\n4、熟悉结构设计流程，对电池特性有基本的了解；\n5、有基本的电气基础知识，能看懂电气原理图，熟悉电气安规设计，懂简单土建设计，了解电力、建筑、消防、运输等相关标准；\n6、精通常用办公及结构设计工具软件；如office、CAD、Pro/E、Catia等。\n7、良好的文档写作、英文阅读能力；\n8、能独立分析和解决问题，学习能力强；\n9、具有强烈的责任心、团队意识，具有良好的沟通及协调、执行能力。","ClassificationOne":"研发类","ClassificationTwo":null,"Classification3":null,"Classification4":null,"Classification5":null,"Classification6":null,"FavoritesStatus":false,"Station":null,"Kind":"全职","Channel4IsHot":false,"Channel4IsLong":false,"Status":1,"Channel4HasReward":false,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendScore":null,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendReward":null,"Channel4RewardDescription":null,"IsCollect":false,"IsDelivered":false,"SubmissionLimit":null,"BelongStoreId":null,"Degree":null,"YearsOfWorking":null,"WorkTime":null,"Insurance":null,"Welfare":null,"WorkWeChatQrCode":null,"Channel4IsAllowCampusRecommend":false,"Channel4CampusReward":null,"Channel4CampusScore":null,"Channel4CampusRewardDescription":null,"Channel4IsAllowExternalRecommend":false,"Channel4ExternalReward":null,"Channel4ExternalScore":null,"Channel4ExternalRewardDescription":null,"InnerChannelIsTop":false,"Channel4SequenceNumber":"","ChangeDate":"2026-06-12T10:05:09","JobVideoJd":null,"IsAllowRepeatDeliverSameJob":false,"AllowRepeatDeliverCount":0,"RepeatDeliverCount":0,"IsShowReward